    "rng": "Mulberry32",
    "runs": "200 seeds for five strategies at 3, 5 and 8 farmers: 12000 games total under None, A, B and C. Pest game skipped to isolate distribution.",
    "neverPromise": "Uniform random currently available card, without promises; role restrictions still apply.",
    "sellPromise": "Always Sell and promise each round except the last.",
    "sharePromise": "Always Share and promise when role restrictions permit; company farmers can only Sell to the company.",
    "random": "Uniform random tap among currently available cards, with independent 50% contract toggle; no promises on the last round. Separate seeded decision stream preserves event comparability.",
    "cooperative": "Coordinate current known need: choose low-opportunity-cost Share/Release routes until need is covered, sell surplus, store a surplus farm on warnings when its cash goal is met; Mae Tha members promise for the next round. Does not inspect future events.",
    "council": "Automatic Council in every table: emergency-buy reserve to cover projected unmet need first, then pay for submitted hub deliveries; never override a farmer’s card. Transport and budget constrain actual delivery.",
    "cash": "Actual end-of-game cash, including early collective losses; only surviving farmers meeting their cash goal win.",
    "waste": "Spoiled harvest plus decay of farmer-owned stock; shared reserve never decays."
